{"name":"Tammar","status":"ok","title":"Tammar","pageId":12944,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Tammar\" title=\"Category:Maps of Tammar\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tammar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">Northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large town</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3,594</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfVGFtbWFyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Tammar (page does not exist)\">Inhabitants of  Tammar</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX1RhbW1hcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Locations in Tammar (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Tammar</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9UYW1tYXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Tammar (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Tammar</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Tammar</b> was a large town in <a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>As of <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, it had a population of 3,594.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>It was razed by the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Tuigan_Horde\" title=\"Tuigan Horde\">Tuigan Horde</a> and subsequently besieged by bandits who took heavy tolls from passing caravans. The government of Thesk hired a hundred <a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">orc</a> soldiers to rid the town of the bandits and these orcs were later hailed as heroes in Tammar. The town was since rebuilt.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p209_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p209-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Novels_&amp;_Short_Stories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tammar?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tammar?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span id=\"Novels_.26_Short_Stories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novel